ied the author for nearly a decade and holds the deepest affection. Yet as it evolved into a full-featured commercial suite, ads and add-ons multiplied while system overhead climbed.…","Obsidian: Open files, closed-source core. Official Sync is paid and third-party sync is tedious; relying entirely on flat local file scanning causes noticeable cold-start and search lag once notes reach thousands or…","Memos & Stream Notes: Clean and simple, but their social-timeline layouts differ fundamentally from the structured productivity of a classic three-pane workflow.","SiYuan & Block-based PKMs: Powerful with self-hosting support, but their granular \"block-level\" architecture imposes noticeable cognitive overhead for quick daily capture and continuous prose writing. Furthermore, they…","Cross-Platform One-Click Clipping: Browser extension clips Xiaohongshu galleries, X (Twitter) posts & quotes, Zhihu Q&As, Reddit discussions, and GitHub repositories (deep adaptation for more platforms coming soon);…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tianma-if/edgeever/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c81bcff8477bbe0d2ab9a72443c68c0489f0c4235fd8059a7522f8eb128cf78d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:09.176Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:45:14.325Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"EdgeEver is a modern, open-source notes and knowledge base workspace. It revives the beloved Evernote-style three-pane layout while offering an open data architecture and seamless AI Agent integration for complete ownership and smart productivity.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tianma-if/edgeever/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"SiYuan & Block-based PKMs: Powerful with self-hosting support, but their granular \"block-level\" architecture imposes noticeable cognitive overhead for quick daily capture and continuous prose writing.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tianma-if/edgeever/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"AI Multi-Dimensional Tables & Public Forms: Generate structured multi-dimensional tables for any business workflow (such as project tracking, content banks, and HR rosters) via natural language AI prompts, inferring tags, dates, and rich field types with sample rows; publish public online collection forms with one click without login requirements, syncing submitted responses…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tianma-if/edgeever/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"All-Platform Coverage & Production Security: Official client support across Web, Android, macOS, Windows, Linux, and iOS, with web clipper extensions for Chrome, Edge, and Firefox; self-hosted synchronization without device limits, lightweight memory footprint on desktop, offline drafts with sync queues, server-side brute-force protection, and isolated multi-user workspaces.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tianma-if/edgeever/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Once deployed, confirm /api/health returns 200, then log in with the configured username and password.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tianma-if/edgeever/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"c81bcff8477bbe0d2ab9a72443c68c0489f0c4235fd8059a7522f8eb128cf78d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tianma-if/edgeever/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:45:14.326Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T04:42:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tianma-if/edgeever/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:45:14.327Z","hash":"c81bcff8477bbe0d2ab9a72443c68c0489f0c4235fd8059a7522f8eb128cf78d","originalBytes":27821,"storedBytes":27821,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["edgeever","docs","notes","cloudflare","nbsp","api","deployment","apps","official","web","sync","content","fork","mcp","native","deploy","docker","local","agent","client","desktop","github","import","storage","support","architecture","create","edge